				<parameterSubstitutions/>
				<documentation value="Reading: FieldReplaceablePart(s).Blade -[is part of]-&gt; CuttingDeck(s).PartCarrier.&#xA;&#xA;Blade end — role: Field-Replaceable Part, multiplicity 0..2&#xA;(a CuttingDeck may carry no blade (0) — during replacement or servicing —&#xA;one blade on a standard deck (1),&#xA;or two blades on a wide-cut deck (2).)&#xA;&#xA;CuttingDeck end — role: Part Carrier, multiplicity 0..1&#xA;(a Blade belongs to at most one CuttingDeck at a time,&#xA;or exists freely as a spare — being sharpened or stored (0).)&#xA;&#xA;Aggregation semantics (hollow diamond):&#xA;The Blade is a Line-Replaceable Unit (LRU) — the farmer replaces it in the field.&#xA;A Blade can exist independently of any CuttingDeck.&#xA;&#xA;The association direction itself is Unspecified."/>
				<appearance linemode="3" linecolor="0" linewidth="0" seqno="0" headStyle="0" lineStyle="0"/>
