				<parameterSubstitutions/>
				<documentation value="Reading: IntegralAssembly(ies).CuttingDeck -[contains]-&amp;gt; LawnMower.EndItem.&#xA;&#xA;CuttingDeck end — role: Integral Assembly, multiplicity 0..2&#xA;(a LawnMower may have no cutting deck (0) — e.g. stripped unit in transit —&#xA;one deck on a single-deck mower (1),&#xA;or two decks on a dual-deck mower (2).)&#xA;&#xA;LawnMower end — role: End Item, multiplicity 1 (default, not shown)&#xA;(a CuttingDeck belongs to exactly one LawnMower.)&#xA;&#xA;Composition semantics (filled diamond):&#xA;The CuttingDeck is an Integral Assembly — a Shop-Replaceable Unit (SRU).&#xA;Under normal farm operating conditions, the farmer does not remove the deck.&#xA;Deck removal requires specialist tools and is carried out at a service centre only.&#xA;The CuttingDeck cannot exist independently of the LawnMower in this model.&#xA;&#xA;The association direction itself is Unspecified."/>
				<appearance linemode="3" linecolor="0" linewidth="0" seqno="0" headStyle="0" lineStyle="0"/>
				<labels lb="0..2" lt="+Integral Assembly" mt="contains" rt="+End Item"/>
