				<documentation value="Reading: IntegralAssembly(ies).Transmission -[contains]-&gt; LawnMower.EndItem.&#xA;&#xA;Transmission end — role: Integral Assembly, multiplicity 0..1&#xA;(a LawnMower has exactly one Transmission (1) in normal configuration,&#xA;or none (0) if stripped for transport or overhaul.)&#xA;&#xA;LawnMower end — role: End Item, multiplicity 1 (default, not shown)&#xA;(a Transmission belongs to exactly one LawnMower.)&#xA;&#xA;Composition semantics (filled diamond):&#xA;The Transmission is an Integral Assembly — a Shop-Replaceable Unit (SRU).&#xA;The farmer does not remove or service the transmission in the field.&#xA;Service requires workshop conditions and specialist tools.&#xA;&#xA;The association direction itself is Unspecified."/>
